OL,3,AMother told to book appointment to give
OL,4,Abirth to her dead baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains themes
OL,7,Fand images some readers may find
OL,8,Fupsetting.
OL,10,FA pregnant woman whose baby had died
OL,11,Fwas sent home from hospital still
OL,12,Fcarrying the child and told to make an
OL,13,Fappointment later in the week to give
OL,14,Fbirth.
OL,16,FDanielle Brown, 31, from North
OL,17,FTyneside, had already been wrongly
OL,18,Fdischarged despite having the
OL,19,Flife-threatening condition
OL,20,Fpre-eclampsia and had returned because
OL,21,Fshe was still unwell.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
