OL,3,AMother told to book appointment to give
OL,4,Abirth to her dead baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter insisting on returning to the
OL,7,Fmaternity unit, she was finally seen
OL,8,Fand doctors discovered her baby had
OL,9,Fdied. Danielle would later describe the
OL,10,Fsilence, the screen turned away from
OL,11,Fher, and turning to her partner to say:
OL,12,F"I think she's gone."
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
