OL,3,AFive teenagers stabbed at Halloween
OL,4,Aparty
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive teenagers have been seriously
OL,7,Finjured after being stabbed at a
OL,8,FHalloween party in Hampshire, police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Park Road in
OL,12,FChandler's Ford, near Eastleigh,
OL,13,Fshortly after 22:30 GMT on Saturday.
OL,15,FThe injured teens - three boys aged 16
OL,16,Fand two aged 17 - were taken to
OL,17,Fhospital.
OL,19,FHampshire Police said it believes an
OL,20,Funknown group gained entry to a party
OL,21,Fat an address on Park Road before the
OL,22,Fstabbings.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
